turmoil drives calls for a new $1 billion ETH-aligned organization\nprimary_headline: Prominent Ethereum voices push for a new $1 billion organization as EF departures deepen the network’s identity crisis\nstory_id: ethereum-ef-exodus-new-org-2026-05-22\nsource_urls: ['https://decrypt.co/368694/prominent-ethereum-dev-proposes-1-billion-eth-organization', 'https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/21/ethereum-s-identity-crisis-is-deepening-after-high-profile-brain-drain-frustrates-the-community', 'https://thedefiant.io/news/blockchains/ef-exodus-fuels-calls-for-new-price-focused-ethereum-organization', 'https://cryptofox.news/news/tom-lee-backs-new-ethereum-advocacy-initiative-amid-market-shifts']\n--- /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-073952\ntopic_theme: None\nprimary_headline: None\nstory_id: None\nsource_urls: None\n--- /tmp/crypto-run-20260522-072258\ntopic_theme: US lawmakers revive strategic Bitcoin reserve push with the ARMA bill\nprimary_headline: US lawmakers renew strategic Bitcoin reserve push with ARMA bill\nstory_id: us-strategic-bitcoin-reserve-arma-bill-2026-05-22\nsource_urls: ['https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-senators-unveil-new-bitcoin-bill-renewing-strategic-reserve-plans', 'https://decrypt.co/368662/proposed-arma-bill-aims-enshrine-strategic-bitcoin-reserve-law', 'https://cryptoslate.com/us-lawmakers-push-new-strategic-bitcoin-reserve-act-to-secure-25-billion-federal-stash/', 'https://cryptofox.news/news/us-lawmakers-introduce-bill-to-establish-strategic-bitcoin-reserve']","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-researcher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779445310414}}
