b\": \"2026-05-22T08:24:46+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"BTC's implied volatility is a picture of calm even as financial headlines warn of macro risks.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"XRP ETFs attract inflows amid wallet surge. bitcoin, ether funds struggle.\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/22/xrp-funds-sees-fresh-inflows-and-wallet-spike-as-bitcoin-ether-funds-bleed\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-22T06:36:18+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Fresh inflows into XRP-linked funds and a spike in newly created wallets suggest some traders may be rotating into the token while trimming exposure to crypto’s largest assets.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Bitcoin trades near $77,700 as analysts eye $75,000 support after liquidation wave\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/22/bitcoin-trades-near-usd77-700-as-analysts-eye-usd75-000-support-after-liquidation-wave\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-22T05:38:22+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Open interest held steady and funding stayed subdued during the recent liquidation wave, suggesting traders were de-risking rather than capitulating, according to HashKey Research's Tim Sun.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"India cracks down on prediction markets: Polymarket goes dark, Kalshi could be next\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/22/india-cracks-down-on-prediction-markets-polymarket-goes-dark-kalshi-could-be-next\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-22T05:14:46+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Polymarket has gone dark in India and as per local media reports, Kalshi could be next.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Satoshi’s 1.1 million bitcoin and millions more can be saved from quantum attack, says expert\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/21/satoshi-s-1-1m-bitcoin-stash-can-be-saved-from-quantum-attack-says-americanfortress\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T19:10:03+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Researchers at the privacy-centric blockchain startup say their multi-layer quantum defense will feature a soft fork to freeze and protect dormant BTC.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Mark Cuban says he sold most of his Bitcoin after failed hedge narrative 'disappointed' the billionaire\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/mark-cuban-says-he-sold-most-of-his-bitcoin-after-failed-hedge-narrative-disappointed-the-billionaire\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T17:30:16+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"The billionaire investor said he sold most of his bitcoin after concluding the cryptocurrency failed to act as a hedge during recent geopolitical turmoil and dollar weakness.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Ethereum’s identity crisis is deepening after high-profile 'brain drain' frustrates the community\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/05/21/ethereum-s-identity-crisis-is-deepening-after-high-profile-brain-drain-frustrates-the-community\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T16:56:33+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"What began earlier this week as shock over more exits of core figures has now evolved into something more existential, according to some community members.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Crypto prediction markets are turning into dangerous national security risks, and Congress wants to ban them\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/crypto-prediction-markets-are-turning-into-dangerous-national-security-risks-and-congress-wants-to-ban-them\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T15:38:47+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Bubblemaps investigators led by Nicolas Vaiman, discovered 80 bets on Polymarket with a 98% win rate that he said is statistically impossible to achieve.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"U.S. CFTC secures deal with National Hockey League on prediction market safeguards\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/05/21/u-s-cftc-secures-deal-with-national-hockey-league-on-prediction-market-safeguards\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T15:12:33+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"A new arrangement has been set between the derivatives regulator and professional hockey, following on the heels of a similar baseball agreement.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Crypto for Advisors: Crypto Products\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/coindesk-indices/2026/05/20/crypto-for-advisors-crypto-products\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T15:00:00+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Advisors need to assess ETP custody, sponsor profiles, and fees. Read expert advice on bitcoin-backed loans, including margin call risks and when to sell vs. borrow.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"MoonPay expands into tokenized assets and DeFi markets with new platform for banks\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/moonpay-expands-into-tokenized-assets-and-defi-markets-with-new-platform-for-banks\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T14:42:16+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"With MoonPay Trade, the crypto payments firm is building infrastructure for banks, fintechs to access stablecoins, tokenized funds and yield in a one-stop shop.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Peer-to-peer trading startup Variational raises $50 million for real-world perps in funding round led by Dragonfly\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/peer-to-peer-trading-startup-variational-raises-usd50-million-for-real-world-perps-in-funding-round-led-by-dragonfly\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:57:00+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"The company is initially offering perpetual futures on real-world assets including oil, silver, copper and gold.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Live markets: Yet another Iran peace deal and Mark Cuban sells his bitcoin\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/live-markets-bitcoin-s-flat-action-continues-as-spacex-ipo-nvidia-earnings-capture-news-cycle\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:51:11+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Hyperliquid's HYPE is the outlier in crypto, rising 16.5% over the past 24 hours to a new record high.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Blockchain.com files with SEC for U.S. IPO\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/blockchain-com-files-confidential-paperwork-with-sec-for-u-s-ipo\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:50:27+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"The crypto financial services firm submitted a draft S-1 to the SEC as it explores a public listing amid renewed momentum in digital asset markets.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Bitcoin's long-term holder supply approaches record high, breaking multi-year downtrend\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/21/bitcoin-s-long-term-holder-supply-approaches-record-high-breaking-multi-year-downtrend\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:23:00+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Long-term holder supply has surged by more than 2 million coins to 16.3 million BTC during the current bear market.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"CoinDesk 20 performance update: Internet Computer drops 1.6%, leading index lower\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/coindesk-indices/2026/05/21/coindesk-20-performance-update-internet-computer-drops-1-6-leading-index-lower\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T13:16:12+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"Hedera (HBAR), down 1.3% from Wednesday, joined Internet Computer (ICP) as an underperformer.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"coindesk.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Stablecoins retain the edge over tokenized money market funds, JPMorgan says\",\n    \"link\": \"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/05/21/stablecoins-retain-the-edge-over-tokenized-money-market-funds-jpmorgan-says\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-21T12:49:17+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"The bank said tokenized money market funds account for only about 5% of the broader stablecoin universe despite offering yield.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"cointelegraph.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Verus bridge exploiter returns $8.5M after bounty offer\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/verus-bridge-hacker-returns-85m-eth-28m-bounty?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\",\n    \"pub\": \"2026-05-22T09:32:03+00:00\",\n    \"desc\": \"The hacker behind the Verus bridge exploit returned 75% of the stolen funds as part of a recovery deal negotiated with the protocol days after the incident.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"feed\": \"cointelegraph.xml\",\n    \"title\": \"Bitcoin price record 90-day uptrend 'resembles bull market rally:' New analysis\",\n    \"link\": \"https://cointelegraph.com/markets/bitcoin-price-record-90-day-uptrend-resembles-bull-market-rally-new-analysis?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\",[... 54094 more characters truncated]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779445597762}}
